<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμῆλιξ</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὐμᾶλιξ</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			30.20
		</span></i> : <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐκος</span>, ὁ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the same age,</i> mostly of
			young persons, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.419
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				444
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				447
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1098
			</span></i>, etc. ; of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραδοχὰς . . ὁμήλικας χρόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					201
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Subst., <i>equal in age, comrade,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίψον σοῖο ἄνακτος ὁμήλικα</span> (of
			an elderly man) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.358
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμαρτος τῆς ἐμῆς ὁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					953
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of like stature,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pr.Im.</u>
				13
			</span></i> : neut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμήλικα ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
